OL,3,GNEWSANew bandstand is safe despite
OL,4,Acracks, charity says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity behind Dorking Bandstand
OL,7,Fsays large cracks in its flooring which
OL,8,Fhave developed since its opening in
OL,9,FJune are "cosmetic".
OL,11,FAlan Moore, who oversaw the build in
OL,12,FMeadowbrook Park on behalf of the
OL,13,FPandemic Community Bandstand group,
OL,14,Fblamed extreme weather conditions for
OL,15,Fthe damage.
OL,17,FHe said severe rain when the concrete
OL,18,Fmixture for a lower layer was poured
OL,19,Fand intense heat as it set had caused
OL,20,Fit to shrink, which then cracked the
OL,21,Fthin screed surface.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
